<title>UK: Meyer Intl cautiosly optimistic on trading.</title>
<headline>Meyer Intl cautiosly optimistic on trading.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building materials and timber company Meyer International Plc said on Wednesday it was cautiously optimistic about current trading conditions.</p>
<p>&quot;We are well positioned to benefit from the improvement in the markets in which we operate, and trading in the first two full months of 1997/98 gives rise to cautious optimism,&quot; chairman Harry Langman said in the firm's earnings statement.</p>
</text>
